			"notes": "- Fixed bug where recipe data wouldn't be kept after player death.\n- Updated how recipe data is saved to the player.\n  - The recipe data now stores \"count\" which is updated each time the recipe is used.\n  - Players saved in ouro 1.0-1.0.1 will have their data updated with \"count\" defaulting to `1`.\n- Added Config to allow for configurable use amounts per recipe.\n  - `<recipe_namespace>:<recipe_path>=<int_uses>`\n    - e.g. `minecraft:spruce_planks=16`\n    - uses default to `*`.\n  - `*=<int_uses>` can be used to define the default use amount.\n    - defaults to `1`.\n  - negative values allow for unlimited uses."
		},
